flowchart TD
    Start([Start: Trigger Schedule & Allocate]) --> CheckAuth{User Authorized as Admin or ATC?}
    CheckAuth -- No --> AccessDenied([Reject Operation: Access Denied])
    CheckAuth -- Yes --> LockQueue[Acquire ReadyQueue Mutex]

    LockQueue --> CheckQueueEmpty{Is ReadyQueue Empty?}
    CheckQueueEmpty -- Yes --> ReleaseQueue1[Release ReadyQueue Mutex]
    ReleaseQueue1 --> EndNoOp([No Waiting Processes: Return Success])

    CheckQueueEmpty -- No --> ApplyAging{Is Priority Aging Enabled?}
    ApplyAging -- Yes --> RunAging[Evaluate Waiting Time & Increment Priority Levels]
    RunAging --> SortQueue[Re-sort ReadyQueue by Priority and Arrival Time]
    ApplyAging -- No --> SortQueue

    SortQueue --> PopCandidate[Pop Candidate Process from Head of Queue]
    PopCandidate --> ReleaseQueue2[Release ReadyQueue Mutex]

    ReleaseQueue2 --> FindRunway[Query ResourceManager for Compatible Free Runway]
    FindRunway --> RunwayAvail{Compatible Free Runway Found?}

    RunwayAvail -- No --> Requeue[Lock ReadyQueue & Push Candidate Back to Head]
    Requeue --> EndBlocked([No Runway Available: Process Remains Ready])

    RunwayAvail -- Yes --> AcquireResLock[Acquire ResourceManager std::mutex Lock]
    AcquireResLock --> VerifyFree{Is Runway Still Free in Memory?}
    VerifyFree -- No --> ReleaseResLock[Release Mutex Lock]
    ReleaseResLock --> Requeue

    VerifyFree -- Yes --> BeginTx[DatabaseManager: Begin MySQL Transaction]
    BeginTx --> RowLock[Execute: SELECT status FROM runways WHERE id=? FOR UPDATE]
    RowLock --> VerifyDbFree{Is Runway FREE in Database?}
    
    VerifyDbFree -- No --> Rollback1[DatabaseManager: Rollback Transaction]
    Rollback1 --> ReleaseResLock
    
    VerifyDbFree -- Yes --> UpdateFlight[UPDATE flights SET status='LANDED'/'DEPARTED']
    UpdateFlight --> InsertAssign[INSERT INTO runway_assignments]
    InsertAssign --> UpdateRunway[UPDATE runways SET status='OCCUPIED', current_flight_id=?]
    UpdateRunway --> UpdateQueue[UPDATE scheduling_queue SET state='COMPLETED']

    UpdateQueue --> CheckAllSql{All 4 SQL Statements Succeeded?}
    CheckAllSql -- No --> Rollback2[DatabaseManager: Rollback Transaction]
    Rollback2 --> ReleaseResLock

    CheckAllSql -- Yes --> CommitTx[DatabaseManager: Commit Transaction]
    CommitTx --> UpdateMemState[Update In-Memory Runway & Process States to RUNNING/COMPLETED]
    UpdateMemState --> ReleaseResLockSuccess[Release ResourceManager Mutex Lock]
    ReleaseResLockSuccess --> AuditLog[Log Action to operation_logs]
    AuditLog --> NotifyUI[Emit Qt Signals to Update GUI Views]
    NotifyUI --> SuccessEnd([Success: Runway Allocated & Flight Dispatched])
